{"type":"message","id":"1b838ca9","parentId":"49feb957","timestamp":"2026-03-19T11:13:11.112Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"590\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"495506013\",\n  \"sender\": \"Matteo Cicalese\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-03-19 11:13 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"Matteo Cicalese (495506013)\",\n  \"id\": \"495506013\",\n  \"name\": \"Matteo Cicalese\",\n  \"username\": \"CicaMatt\"\n}\n```\n\nHi, I’m feeling quite exhausted lately and I’ve started having this persistent,\ndull ache in my lower back on the right side. It’s been getting worse over the last few\nmonths. I’ve already sent you my EHR for the last 3 years and my DNA report."}],"timestamp":1773918791109}}
